; The "cache" boots run on a devicetree in which the boot CPU carries an
; L1I, an L1D and an L2 (patch_dtb.py), so the eight AT_L*_CACHE* words are
; not all zero and State.cache_size_word and State.cache_geometry_word are
; checked against what the kernel published.
(rule
 (targets StartStateDefconfigCacheSeed1Fixture.v)
 (deps
  %{project_root}/tools/placement_conformance/start_state_to_rocq.py
  placement/linux-6.18.46-defconfig-cache-seed1-fixture.log)
